    "observed": "9 MiB allocation, 8 MiB async-copy input freed through native API; reserved_bytes becomes 1 MiB, live host/device values preserved, but allocated_bytes.current increases by 1 and allocated_bytes.freed is -1. Active allocated_bytes counters cannot represent physical host usage.",
